  <title xml:lang="EN">NGO Support / Black Sea Peacebuilding Network</title>
  <description xml:lang="EN">Four leading think-tanks and NGOs from Armenia_ R. Moldova_ Georgia and Azerbaijan and CMI aim to motor a Black Sea regional network of non-governmental organizations on peace-building issues with strong linkages at the European level. The objectives of the network are to foster local ownership and regional collaboration between peacebuilding organizations in the black Sea area; to improve learning from the four conflict-settings (Transnistria_ Abkhazia_ South Ossetia and Nagorno-Karabakh) and to identify common approaches for key regional actors and EU_ to strenghten peace-building capacities at local level (the policy and grass roots levels) and to ensure efficient communication and aadvocacy at the EU policy level through a web of relations with EU institutions_ member states and European NGOs.</description>
